  "pre_registration_summary": "With 250 independent author clusters and 624 tasks, the study is adequately powered (>= 80%) for effect sizes Delta >= +7.5pp when discordance D <= 0.20 and ICC <= 0.10. For the MCID boundary of Delta = +5.0pp, power reaches 80% when D <= 0.10. Holm-Bonferroni correction strictly guards the 5-hypothesis family against type-I error inflation."
